  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;denote the greatest integer <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msqrt><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msqrt><mn>120</mn></msqrt></mfenced></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "825",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msqrt><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msqrt><mn>120</mn></msqrt></mfenced></math></p><p>Now we now that,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>when</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>when</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;and similarly&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>when</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Now using the above formula we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>21</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>r</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>21</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>770</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>55</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>825</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
